"Slide: the pages slide with your finger." = "頁面滑動：頁面跟隨手指滑動。";
"Spread Fade: a tap turns the page with a fade spreading from where you tapped." = "擴散漸變：點擊翻頁時，從點擊位置向外擴散漸變翻掉整頁。";
"Page Fade: a tap fades the whole page into the next." = "整頁漸變：點擊翻頁時，整頁漸變為下一頁。";
"A tap slides the next page in." = "點擊翻頁時，下一頁滑入。";
"How a tap turns the page (slide, page fade or spread fade) is set in Reading › Tap to Turn." = "點擊翻頁的效果（頁面滑動、整頁漸變或擴散漸變）在「閱讀 › 點擊翻頁」中設定。";
"Allow Smaller Pages" = "允許縮小到小於螢幕";
"Pinching in can make a page smaller than the screen, with black around it. Off, a page fills the screen at least; pinching only enlarges it." = "開啟後，雙指捏合可以把頁面縮小到比螢幕還小，四周留黑邊。關閉時頁面至少鋪滿螢幕，捏合只能放大。";
"Double Tap Top to Go to Start" = "點兩下頂部回到開頭";
"Double-tap the title at the top of the reader to go back to the first page." = "點兩下閱讀器頂部的標題回到第一頁。";
"Next Page" = "下一頁";
"Previous Page" = "上一頁";
"Apple Pencil" = "Apple Pencil";
"Double-Tap" = "點兩下";
"Squeeze" = "輕捏";
"Detected: Apple Pencil Pro (it was squeezed)." = "已偵測到：Apple Pencil Pro（收到過輕捏）。";
"Detected: Apple Pencil (2nd generation) or Pro (it was double-tapped)." = "已偵測到：Apple Pencil（第 2 代）或 Pro（收到過點兩下）。";
"Double-tap is off in Settings › Apple Pencil, so the reader doesn't respond to it." = "「設定 › Apple Pencil」裡關閉了點兩下，閱讀器不會回應。";
"Squeeze is off in Settings › Apple Pencil, so the reader doesn't respond to it." = "「設定 › Apple Pencil」裡關閉了輕捏，閱讀器不會回應。";
"This iPad works with Apple Pencil Pro: while reading, double-tap or squeeze it, held away from the screen." = "這台 iPad 支援 Apple Pencil Pro：閱讀時把筆拿在手上（不用碰螢幕）點兩下或輕捏即可。";
"This iPad works with Apple Pencil (2nd generation): while reading, double-tap it, held away from the screen. Squeezing needs Apple Pencil Pro, which this iPad doesn't work with." = "這台 iPad 支援 Apple Pencil（第 2 代）：閱讀時把筆拿在手上（不用碰螢幕）點兩下即可。輕捏需要 Apple Pencil Pro，這台 iPad 不支援。";
"The Apple Pencil this iPad works with can't double-tap or squeeze, so it can't turn pages." = "這台 iPad 支援的 Apple Pencil 沒有點兩下和輕捏，無法用來翻頁。";
"While reading, double-tap Apple Pencil (2nd generation) or Pro, or squeeze Apple Pencil Pro, held away from the screen." = "閱讀時把筆拿在手上（不用碰螢幕）：Apple Pencil（第 2 代）或 Pro 點兩下，Apple Pencil Pro 還可以輕捏。";
"Try it here: double-tap or squeeze the pencil." = "在這裡試試：點兩下或輕捏筆身。";
"Double-tap received." = "收到點兩下。";
"Squeeze received." = "收到輕捏。";
"Keyboard and Page Turner" = "鍵盤與翻頁器";
"Keys Turn Pages" = "按鍵翻頁";
"Swap Next and Previous" = "交換上一頁和下一頁";
"Connected: %@" = "已連線：%@";
"Keyboard" = "鍵盤";
"→ ↓, Page Down and Space turn to the next page; ← ↑ and Page Up to the previous one (← → follow the reading direction). In the continuous modes they scroll a screen. Most Bluetooth page turners send these keys; ones that send the volume buttons can't turn pages on iPhone and iPad." = "→ ↓、Page Down 和空白鍵翻到下一頁；← ↑ 和 Page Up 翻到上一頁（← → 跟隨閱讀方向）。連續模式下按一次捲動一個螢幕。大多數藍牙翻頁器傳送的就是這些按鍵；傳送音量鍵的翻頁器在 iPhone 和 iPad 上無法翻頁。";
"→ ↓, Page Down and Space turn to the next page; ← ↑ and Page Up to the previous one (← → follow the reading direction). In the continuous modes they scroll a screen. Most Bluetooth page turners send these keys; ones that send the volume buttons use Volume Keys Turn Pages." = "→ ↓、Page Down 和空白鍵翻到下一頁；← ↑ 和 Page Up 翻到上一頁（← → 跟隨閱讀方向）。連續模式下按一次捲動一個螢幕。大多數藍牙翻頁器傳送的就是這些按鍵；傳送音量鍵的翻頁器請使用「音量鍵翻頁」。";
"Stylus" = "手寫筆";
"Pen Button" = "筆身按鍵";
"Second Button" = "第二按鍵";
"Tail Button" = "筆尾按鍵";
"While reading, press a button of the stylus held over the screen; pens with Bluetooth buttons (Android 14 and later) work away from it too. Which buttons a pen has depends on the pen." = "閱讀時，把筆懸停在螢幕上方按筆上的按鍵；帶藍牙按鍵的筆（Android 14 以上）離開螢幕也能用。筆有哪些按鍵取決於筆的型號。";
"Galaxy S Pen: turn on AENHT in Settings › Advanced features › S Pen › Air actions. Then a press of the S Pen's button turns to the next page, a double press to the previous one, and swipes left and right in the air turn too." = "Galaxy S Pen：在「設定 › 進階功能 › S Pen › 隔空操作」裡開啟 AENHT。之後按一下 S Pen 按鍵翻到下一頁，按兩下翻到上一頁，在空中向左、向右揮動也能翻頁。";
"A Windows pen paired over Bluetooth (such as Surface Pen): a click of its top button turns to the next page, a double click to the previous one." = "透過藍牙配對的 Windows 筆（如 Surface 手寫筆）：按一下筆尾按鍵翻到下一頁，按兩下翻到上一頁。";
"Paste Cookies" = "貼上 Cookie";
"Filled in from the copied text." = "已根據拷貝的文字自動填入。";
"The copied text has no E-Hentai cookies." = "拷貝的文字裡沒有 E-Hentai 的 Cookie。";
"Copied cookies are filled in by themselves, all of them at once: a Cookie header, a cookie extension's export or a cookies.txt file. Pasting into any field works too." = "拷貝的 Cookie 會自動辨識並一次填好：Cookie 標頭、Cookie 延伸功能匯出的內容或 cookies.txt 檔案都可以。貼到任一欄也可以。";
"Pages left: %lld" = "剩餘 %lld 頁";
"Page Turns" = "翻頁方式";
"Page Size" = "頁面大小";
"Control Bar" = "控制列";
"Reader Settings Button" = "閱讀設定按鈕";
"Auto Read Button" = "自動閱讀按鈕";
"Auto Scroll Button" = "自動捲動按鈕";
"Tap the Middle to Show Controls" = "僅點擊中間叫出控制列";
"Tap the Middle to Show Controls: a tap on either side (where the tap zones are; left and right when scrolling) doesn't show or hide the controls." = "僅點擊中間叫出控制列：點擊兩側（點擊翻頁區域所在的位置；連續模式下為左右兩側）不會叫出或隱藏控制列。";
"Refresh Favorites When Opened" = "打開收藏時自動重新整理";
"Opening Favorites reloads the site's list, so a gallery just favorited is there without pulling to refresh. Not when the list is scrolled down (your place stays). All syncs its copy when it's older than 15 minutes." = "打開「收藏」時會重新讀取網站上的列表，剛收藏的作品不用下拉重新整理就會出現。列表已經往下捲動時不會重新整理（保留瀏覽位置）。「全部」在本機副本超過 15 分鐘時同步。";
"Deselect All" = "取消全選";
"%lld Selected" = "已選 %lld 項";
"Remove" = "移除";
"Removing…" = "正在移除…";
"Couldn't Remove" = "無法移除";
"Remove %lld from favorites?" = "從收藏中移除 %lld 項？";
"They are removed from your favorites on the site too." = "網站上的收藏也會一起移除。";
"Delete %lld from history?" = "從瀏覽紀錄中刪除 %lld 項？";
"Follows Your Hand" = "跟隨手的位置";
"Auto Read Button Side" = "自動閱讀按鈕位置";
"Auto Scroll Button Side" = "自動捲動按鈕位置";
"The buttons float above the slider: one alone on the side of your hand (where you tapped to show the controls); both, Auto Read on the side chosen and Reader Settings on the other. Reader Settings is also in the menu at the top right." = "按鈕懸浮在進度條上方：只開一個時，放在手的那一側（點擊叫出控制列的位置）；兩個都開時，自動閱讀按鈕放在選定的一側，閱讀設定按鈕放在另一側。閱讀設定也可以從右上角的選單打開。";
"Long-press the Auto Read button for its speed and options; a tap starts or stops it." = "長按自動閱讀按鈕可以調整速度和相關選項；點一下開始或停止。";
"Reload Page" = "重新載入此頁";
"Page %lld" = "第 %lld 頁";
